# Routing — web

## i18n

Routes live under `[lang]/` (`en`, `pl`, …). `/` and `/en` redirect → `/en/home`.

## Page convention

Thin wrapper — imports a section component:

```vue
<!-- web/src/pages/[lang]/home.vue -->
<script setup lang="ts">
import NucHomePage from '../home/index.vue'
</script>
<template><NucHomePage /></template>
```

## API

`web/src/server/api/[...slug].ts` → `dispatchSupabaseApiGateway` from `shared_modules/nuc_api`.
